bluejetty:00036333:ios.description:
Room Makeover is a new casual game! It's an awesome puzzle game for your leisure time. In addition, you can enjoy the fun of decorating in Room Makeover, and build your dream home!
Room Makeover is simple to play and super addictive. How to play?
1. Click and swipe the tool to flush the dirty wall;
2. Win the screw levels to get new cleaning tools;
3. As the level progresses, various cleaning tools are gradually unlocked to clean the room and yard;
4. There are a variety of rooms for you to renovate: flower room, luxury storage room, exquisite kitchen, etc.
About decoration:
After completing the main levels, you will get renovation tickets, and you can use the tickets to choose your favorite furniture to decorate your home.
Room Makeover exercises your brain and logical thinking and relaxes your body and mind. Come to join us and enjoy the fun game!

